.DS_Store

# Terraform working data and local/remote state
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/backend.hcl
**/backend_override.tf
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars.json
**/*.tfvars.json
**/*.tfplan
**/tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Azure CLI configuration must remain outside the repository
**/.azure/
**/.azure-*/

# Local credentials and secret-bearing files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.keystore
*.jks
**/secrets.*
**/credentials.*
**/*secret*.json
**/*credential*.json

# Generated Temporary Access Pass handoff files
**/team-user-access/

# Static participant portal and locally exported credentials
**/node_modules/
/web/dist/
/web/public/catalog.json
/web/public/catalog-keys.json
/web/public/.catalog*.tmp-*
/web/test-results/
/web/playwright-report/
